From 5c8f41fd8e2c92100fbe83cf104b30643f35ca24 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: heresy <heresy@local>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 18:03:10 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1015/1198] Viktor's two themes, light by default, day and
 night as is customary
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

HERESY 1015.
- Scroll & Brick and Scroll by Lamplight (igr.bible by day and by night) from
  YuE2 Studio: background and accent as Studio defines them, the rest derived
  with Studio's own mixes and mapped onto the Kit's variables; every text
  colour then pushed until it clears 4.5:1 on every surface, the Kit's rule
  (the night accent moved by a hair, #ef6b6b to #f07171). First in the list.
- Scroll & Brick is the default theme.
- A day / night / as-the-system button (☀ ☾ ◐) beside the theme picker. Day
  and night keep their own themes: a light one kept in the list becomes the
  day theme, a dark one the night theme. A theme already chosen in a browser
  is kept on the first run, as the day or night one it is.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
